        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Roll the dough out thin and spread the filling right to the edges -- this is how you get a proper swirl in every bite. Use a sharp knife or unflavoured dental floss to cut the rolls cleanly without squashing them."
          }
        ]
      },
